{
	"description": "Thinking-off rules of _shared/modules/llm/api_providers.json, replayed by _shared/lua/llm/thinking_off.lua (macOS and Linux suites) and its AutoHotkey port _shared/modules/llm/thinking_off.ahk (Windows suite), so the drivers cannot drift.",
	"rule": "glob_vectors: a glob matches the whole model id, ignoring case, with * as the only wildcard. merge_vectors: fields deep-merged into body give expected; the body wins at every level. provider_vectors: the provider's shipped thinking_off applied to model over body gives expected; rule is the 1-based index of the first matching rule, absent when none matches. parse_vectors: a thinking_off list is accepted whole (valid true) or refused whole (valid false).",
